      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "WRITE: POST /post {content:\"Hello!\", authorId:123}\n  -> PostsDB INSERT post (id=postId1, user_id=123, content=\"Hello!\", created_at=NOW)\n  -> Fanout Worker (async): lookup friends of user 123 (e.g. [456, 789, 1011...])\n     -> Redis LPUSH feed:userId:456 postId1  (pre-populate each friend's feed list)\n        Redis LPUSH feed:userId:789 postId1\n        Redis LPUSH feed:userId:1011 postId1  ... (for each friend)\n\nREAD: GET /newsfeed?userId=456&limit=20\n  -> Redis LRANGE feed:userId:456 0 19  =>  [postId1, postId3, postId7, ...]\n  -> Batch GET from Posts DB:  SELECT * FROM posts WHERE id IN (postId1, postId3, postId7, ...)\n  -> Response: [{id:postId1, author:\"Alice\", content:\"Hello!\", likes:14}, ...]",
      "originalText": "WRITE: POST /post {content:\"Hello!\", authorId:123}\n  -> PostsDB INSERT post (id=postId1, user_id=123, content=\"Hello!\", created_at=NOW)\n  -> Fanout Worker (async): lookup friends of user 123 (e.g. [456, 789, 1011...])\n     -> Redis LPUSH feed:userId:456 postId1  (pre-populate each friend's feed list)\n        Redis LPUSH feed:userId:789 postId1\n        Redis LPUSH feed:userId:1011 postId1  ... (for each friend)\n\nREAD: GET /newsfeed?userId=456&limit=20\n  -> Redis LRANGE feed:userId:456 0 19  =>  [postId1, postId3, postId7, ...]\n  -> Batch GET from Posts DB:  SELECT * FROM posts WHERE id IN (postId1, postId3, postId7, ...)\n  -> Response: [{id:postId1, author:\"Alice\", content:\"Hello!\", likes:14}, ...]",
      "fontSize": 14,
      "fontFamily": 3,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": "evidence-fb-basic",
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    }
